        "message": "=```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <title>Invoice Report</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 20px;\">\n\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" \n          style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden;\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" \n              style=\"background:#111827; padding:30px;\">\n              <h1 style=\"color:#ffffff; margin:0; font-size:28px;\">\n                Invoice Report\n              </h1>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Content -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:40px; color:#333333;\">\n\n              <p style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n                Hello,\n              </p>\n\n              <p style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.7;\">\n                Your invoice has been processed successfully.  \n                Please find the invoice details below:\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Invoice Table -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"\n                style=\"border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:20px;\">\n\n                <tr style=\"background:#f3f4f6;\">\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Invoice Name</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.name }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Company Name</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.property_company_name }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr style=\"background:#f3f4f6;\">\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Client Email</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.property_email }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Description</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.property_description }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr style=\"background:#f3f4f6;\">\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Invoice Amount</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.property_amount }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Additional Fee</td>\n                  <td>{{ $json.property_additional_fee }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr style=\"background:#f3f4f6;\">\n                  <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Invoice File</td>\n                  <td>\n                    <a href=\"{{ $json.url }}\" \n                      style=\"color:#2563eb; text-decoration:none;\">\n                      View Invoice\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- Footer -->\n              <p style=\"margin-top:40px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;\">\n                Thank you for your business.<br>\n                If you have any questions regarding this invoice, feel free to contact us.\n              </p>\n\n              <p style=\"margin-top:30px;\">\n                Best Regards,<br>\n                <strong>Invoice Automation System</strong>\n              </p>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" \n              style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:20px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\">\n              © 2026 Invoice Automation System. All rights reserved.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n",
